  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening national nutrition information systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the proposed initiative is increased uptake of nutrition information and improved knowledge for policy and programme development, implementation and monitoring. The specific objective of this project is improved NIS and country capacity in monitoring programmes and national/international nutrition targets.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
